{"id":"d387a906642794f7","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-hyp.md","title":"超算术集合：记号索引版本","display":"df-hyp — 超算术集合：记号索引版本","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-hyp","aliases":["20-df-hyp"],"display":"df-hyp — 超算术集合：记号索引版本","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"definition-source-pending","source_reference":"既有条目的类型与依赖修复；书外补充","depends_on":["[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-hyp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-hyp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyp — 超算术集合：记号索引版本"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-source-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有条目的类型与依赖修复；书外补充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a7474d8b25c4444\" href=\"?note=1a7474d8b25c4444\" title=\"20-df-hyp-hierarchy\">20-df-hyp-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a7474d8b25c4444\" href=\"?note=1a7474d8b25c4444\" title=\"20-df-hyp-hierarchy\">20-df-hyp-hierarchy</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}\\)</span> 是上游 hyp 中的自然数集合族。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 definition-source-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HYP}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [A\\le_TH_a]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HYP}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [A\\le_TH_a]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>改为存在有效记号，而非只存在一个未提供计算表示的序数。该定义通过上游书外记号层级使用，尚不能据它宣称全部超算术结果已由 Soare 2016 支持。</p>\n<p>来源：既有条目的类型与依赖修复；书外补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HYP}=\\{A:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ A\\le_TH_a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HYP}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O\\ [A\\le_TH_a]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"77b50faea085ff34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-hyp]]。"},{"id":"b65e5f1831d9a0f7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"1f0cef53db54a686","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp]]；[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；[[20-df-kleene-O]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-465","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-465","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp]]"}],"outgoing":["1a7474d8b25c4444","52376918bee1945e"]}